<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Implementation details</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Detailed training hyperparameters for both stages of the VOLD  framework are provided in Table <a href="#A1.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ Appendix A Implementation details ‣ VOLD: Reasoning Transfer from LLMs to Vision-Language Models via On-Policy Distillation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>. SFT experiments were conducted using <math id="A1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="32" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>32</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">32</annotation></semantics></math> A100 GPUs and RL on <math id="A1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="4" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>4</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">4</annotation></semantics></math> A100 GPUs, with gradient accumulation to achieve the specified effective batch sizes.</p>
</div>
